  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "One day, after getting completely wasted, Suyeong is suddenly summoned by a fortune-teller (a witch) near a tarot shop. The witch claims she can give Suyeong whatever he desires most and hands him a love potion. Too drunk to think straight, Suyeong downs it in one shot—only to immediately collapse and fall asleep. And then, right in front of the unconscious Suyeong… a system window appears!\n\n[ \\~You are now the protagonist of a seductive harem story!~ ]\n\nThe duration: just one week! For that week, countless men will flock to him. But once the week ends, everyone’s memories vanish, and time rewinds exactly one week back!\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/the_world_of_harem), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/world_of_harem), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/961087238), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13119219), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065277)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/the_world_of_harem), [Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/316661/)",
